<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *7.40	MATURITY    04.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  101.345   PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.60     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS AN ISSUERS OPTION TO SWITCH TO 3M-LIBOR</p>
<p>		PLUS 10 BP COUPON ANNUALLY FROM 04.APR.98</p>
